Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystique is dead\N神秘感荡然无存
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Last year was bad\N去年糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I let myself get \N我放任自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucked in by arithmetic\N陷入卡路里计算的漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Felt great to strip\N剥离脂肪的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,New waist to hip\N崭新的腰臀比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit\N我耻于承认
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how much I paid for it\N为此付出的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I cry myself to sleep about that?\N我是否为此哭到入睡？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheat about that?\N欺骗自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Rot teeth about that?\N牙齿为此腐烂？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I sweat hours a week about that?\N是否每周为此挥汗如雨？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Compete about that?\N与人较劲？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose my freak about that?\N为此失魂落魄？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, all of the above\N呵，以上皆是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna punch the mirror\N我想打碎镜子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.39,0:01:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To make her see that this won't last\N让她明白这不会长久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be months of bad luck\N或许是数月厄运作祟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it's just broken glass?\N但若只是扭曲的镜面呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent my summer getting lost in math\N整个夏天我迷失在数字中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Making weight took all I had\N减重耗尽我所有力气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't outrun her if you don't hit back\N若不自救 终将被她吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just broken glass\N不过是破碎的镜面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to quit\N我恐惧放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Loosen my grip\N松开掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tough to admit\N难以启齿的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how much I get from it\N我从中获得多少满足
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I cry myself to sleep about that\N当为此哭到入睡时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheat about that\N自欺欺人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in too deep about that\N深陷其中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When I sweat hours a week about that\N当每周为此挥汗数小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Competе about that\N争强好胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lettin' her treat mе like that\N放任她如此践踏我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that it's love\N我想这就是爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna punch the mirror\N我想打碎镜子
